      "raw": "<p>I apologize if this has been addressed elsewhere, but I have not been able to find it. If it is in the rulebook and I somehow overlooked it, I will feel equally, if not more, foolish, but..., here it goes:</p><p>Does a Nemesis Bonus not apply to one&#39;s self? If Tachyon redirects the damage that would have been dealt to her via [Synaptic Interferance] back onto Baron Blade, then wouldn&#39;t Baron Blade suffer said damage plus 1?</p>",
