      "raw": "[quote=\"Arcanist Lupus\"]\n\nTwo cards from the same deck aren&#39;t nemeses either, right? &nbsp;For things like the Ennead, the Chairman/Operative, and the Sentinels.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYes they can be. If Operative dealt the Chairman damage, it would be increased due to the nemesis bonus. Ennead members are the same way.\n\n<em>Any</em> <em>different card</em> that shares a nemesis symbol would get the bonus damage applied to them, even if they come from the same deck.&nbsp;\n",
